# Device sync

Financial collections (`payments`, `packages`, `reminders`, …) sync with **paginated GET + small `/delta`**. Do not PUT the whole workspace because the phone cache has more rows than `/status`.

```javascript
// BAD — 413 + desktop receipts never arrive on Android
if (localCount > serverTotal) { _forceNextServerSync(); return; }

// GOOD
window._forceNextSync = false;
window._avoidFullDocumentSync = true;
// then hydrate pages with reset: true
```

- Todo ticks must not mark the document baseline as fully synced or drop the durable payments queue.
- After a 413, set `_avoidFullDocumentSync` and retry a capped delta — never another full PUT.
- Bump `TP_ASSET_V` and `team-pulse-static-v*` together in `app.js`, `app.html`, `sw.js`.
- `/app` shell must stay **network-first** so phones pick up that version without a manual cache wipe.
